          </div>
          <div class="of-project__detail">
            <span class="of-project__detail-label">Challenge</span>
            <span class="of-project__detail-val">Intense sunset glare striking west-facing windows from 5–8pm — exactly prime dinner hours. Guests near the front windows were squinting and requesting table changes; the host team began pre-emptively seating parties away from the windows. Booth occupancy near the facade dropped significantly during evening service.</span>
