                <p>We visit your restaurant and assess window orientation, dining traffic patterns, and ambiance goals to recommend the right restaurant window film for Philadelphia dining spaces. We measure glass area, identify exposure challenges (west sunset, south midday, east morning), and bring physical film samples so you can see exactly how each option looks on your glass before committing.</p>
