                <span class="es-accordion__icon">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="es-accordion__body">
                <p>Installation is scheduled outside peak service hours — early morning, late night, or dark days — to avoid any disruption to your dining room or staff. We work around your reservation book, not ours. For larger restaurant spaces, we phase the work to ensure zero interference with service.</p>
